Object.assign(TR_CJK.zh, {"Collapsed notch style": "收起时的刘海样式", "Normal": "标准", "Compact": "紧凑", "Slim": "纤细", "Compact: a smaller collapsed notch. Slim: only a thin line stays at the top; hover it to expand.": "紧凑：收起时的刘海更小。纤细：只在顶部留下一条细线，鼠标悬停后展开。", "Info in the small notch": "在小刘海中显示的信息", "For example D-12 | Final exam. Click to open the Agenda tab.": "例如 D-12 | 期末考试。点击打开“日程”标签页。", "For example 18° Clear. The weather of your location (or the city you picked).": "例如 18° 晴。显示你所在位置（或所选城市）的天气。", "GPU usage": "GPU 使用率", "How hard the graphics card is working.": "显示显卡的负载程度。", "Clipboard, Agenda & Weather": "剪贴板、日程与天气", "Do Not Disturb is off while focusing, so Windows notifications still arrive.": "专注期间勿扰模式已关闭，Windows 通知仍会弹出。", "Water is off. No reminders arrive and the Water tab says it is off until you turn it on.": "喝水功能已关闭。开启前不会收到提醒，喝水标签页也会显示已关闭。", "Due-date reminders are off. The To-do tab still works but will not alert you when a task is due.": "到期提醒已关闭。待办标签页仍可使用，但任务到期时不会提醒你。", "Water": "喝水", "Off stops the reminders and the settings below.": "关闭后将停止提醒，下方设置也无法使用。", "Use my location for the weather": "使用我的位置查看天气", "Shows the weather where this PC is, using the Windows location service. If the location is unavailable, the city you pick below is used. The location is not saved.": "通过 Windows 位置服务显示这台电脑所在地的天气。位置不可用时使用下方选择的城市。不会保存位置。", "Key for measured air quality": "实测空气质量所需的密钥", "data.go.kr service key (optional)": "公共数据门户服务密钥（可选）", "To get measured air quality from the nearest station in Korea, request “Korea Environment Corporation AirKorea air pollution information” on data.go.kr (free) and paste the key here. Left empty, a forecast-model value is shown and marked as an estimate.": "要获取韩国最近监测站的实测空气质量，请在公共数据门户（data.go.kr）免费申请“韩国环境公团 AirKorea 大气污染信息”，并把密钥粘贴到这里。留空时会显示预测模型的数值，并标注为“估算”。"});
